s who truly has the power to dominate.","description":"Strength Wars: The Movie follows eight athletes training for the ultimate strength competition, where different disciplines collide. With only one winner crowned the strongest, the film explores who truly has the power to dominate.","duration":7614000,"originalContentDuration":6534000,"allotment":7614,"rating":"12+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/screenshot16_9_1789418521507.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Documentary","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/poster_1789418521507.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/screenshot4_3_1789418521507.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/screenshot16_9_1789418521507.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"633446a940766f0007ad85a9"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/poster16_9_1789418521507.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Larry Wheels","Terron Bekcham","NDO Champ","Jerry Pritchett","Blaine Sumner","Neechi Sosa"],"directors":["Vlad Yudin"],"producers":["Vlad Yudin","Edwin Mejia Jr.","david Gendron"],"originalReleaseDate":"2021-04-16T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"cc":true,"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/6aa85c18fb1489fc5cc562fb/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=GB&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=51.5100&deviceLon=-0.0800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=GB&serverSideAds=true&sessionID=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&sid=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&userId=&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjU3MGE4NTE5LTNhNzEtNGQ1Ni1iMTAyLTIwN2Q4MjI4MTZkYiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..12EU-uv7NlsyswTGY3ySL8nLtjjLm4qOFCmlC5Bnkno&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"6aa992e1a586c4b3c9d2cce2-uk":{"_id":"6aa992e1a586c4b3c9d2cce2","seriesID":"6aa992e0a586c4b3c9d2ccc3","slug":"the-hurt-business-2016-1-1-ptv4","name":"The Hurt Business","summary":"The Hurt Business offers an unflinching look at mixed martial arts, exploring the violence, controversy, and rapid rise of the sport. It follows fighters through their struggles, sacrifices, and triumphs inside the cage and beyond.","description":"From the producers of ‘Bowling for Columbine’, ‘Fahrenheit 9/11’ and ‘Generation Iron’, ‘The Hurt Business’ is narrated by Kevin Costner and details the lives of martial arts superstars, including Jon Jones, Georges St-Pierre and Ronda Rousey competing in one of the fastest growing sports in the world and the struggles and triumphs that accompany all careers in cage fighting. Besides featuring legends, such as Georges St-Pierre, and up-and-comers in the sport the film covers the history of mixed martial arts fighting, from the coliseums of ancient Greece to modern day venues such as the MGM Grand in Las Vegas, all expertly narrated by Kevin Costner. Themes of injury both mental and physical are explored and the question is raised; is it worth it to sacrifice one’s mind and body for sport?","duration":7747000,"originalContentDuration":6667000,"allotment":7747,"rating":"12+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa992e1a586c4b3c9d2cce2/screenshot16_9_1789498083751.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Documentary","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/