awke","Juliette Binoche"],"directors":["Hirokazu Koreeda"],"originalReleaseDate":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/69381309843d41d24926375f/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=GB&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=51.5100&deviceLon=-0.0800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=GB&serverSideAds=true&sessionID=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&sid=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&userId=&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjU3MGE4NTE5LTNhNzEtNGQ1Ni1iMTAyLTIwN2Q4MjI4MTZkYiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..12EU-uv7NlsyswTGY3ySL8nLtjjLm4qOFCmlC5Bnkno&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4-uk":{"_id":"693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4","seriesID":"6938130c843d41d249270db1","slug":"the-hunter-2011-2012-1-1","name":"The Hunter (2011)","summary":"A ruthless mercenary with a secret agenda comes to Australia to search for the last remaining Tasmanian Tiger.","description":"A ruthless mercenary with a secret agenda comes to Australia to search for the last remaining Tasmanian Tiger. As his dramatic hunt for the elusive Tiger goes on and he discovers the mysteries hidden within the wild landscape, long-forgotten emotions resurface. Can a human who has led an immoral life find connection and redemption too? Based on the acclaimed novel by Julia Leigh, The Hunter is a powerful psychological drama that tells the story of Martin (Willem Dafoe), a mercenary sent from Europe by a mysterious biotech company to the Tasmanian wilderness on a dramatic hunt for the last Tasmanian Tiger. Directed by Daniel Nettheim, The Hunter stars Academy Award® nominee Willem Dafoe (Antichrist, Spider-man, The English Patient, Platoon), Frances O'Connor (Artificial Intelligence, AI, Mansfield Park) and Sam Neill (The Dish, Jurassic Park, The Piano).","duration":7212000,"originalContentDuration":6132000,"allotment":7212,"rating":"15+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/screenshot16_9_1765283524912.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Drama","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/poster_1765283524912.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/screenshot4_3_1765283524912.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/screenshot16_9_1765283524912.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"690cc49de1ac90de1202d714"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/poster16_9_1765283524912.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"originalReleaseDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/693816c41a8e9be91b85f3a4/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=GB&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=51.5100&deviceLon=-0.0800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=GB&serverSideAds=true&sessionID=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&sid=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&userId=&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjU3MGE4NTE5LTNhNzEtNGQ1Ni1iMTAyLTIwN2Q4MjI4MTZkYiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..12EU-uv7NlsyswTGY3ySL8nLtjjLm4qOFCmlC5Bnkno&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"696758b8c1938362f33df616-uk":{"_id":"696758b8c1938362f33df616","seriesID":"696756d8f65a7c96c6d0cd18","slug":"so-long-my-son-2019-1-1","name":"So Long, My Son","summary":"Two married couples adjust to the vast social and economic changes taking place in China from the 1980s to the present.","description":"Two married couples adjust to the vast social and economic changes taking place in China from the 1980s to the present.","duration":13283000,"originalContentDuration":11123000,"allotment":13283,"rating":"12+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/696758b8c1938362f33df616/screenshot16_9_1768380601477.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Drama","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/696758b8c1938362f33df616/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/696758b8c1938362f33df616/poster_1768380601477.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/696758b8c1938362f33df616/screenshot4_3_1768380601477.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/696758b8c1938362f33df616/screenshot16_9_1768380601477.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"690cc49de1ac90de1202d714"},{"id":"65cb527b33ea86000885853f"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/696758b8c1938362f33df616/poster16_9_1768380601477.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Cheng Xu","Guo-Zhang","Jiang Du","Jingchun Wang","Jingjing Li","Liya Ai","Mei Yong","Roy Wang","Xi Qi","Yanguozhang Zhao"],"directors":["Xiaoshuai Wang"],"producers":["Hai Wang","Jianv Han","Junyi He"],"originalReleaseDate":"2019-02-14T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/696758b8c1938362f33df616/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=GB&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=51.5100&deviceLon=-0.0800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=GB&serverSideAds=true&sessionID=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&sid=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&userId=&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjU3MGE4NTE5LTNhNzEtNGQ1Ni1iMTAyLTIwN2Q4MjI4MTZkYiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..12EU-uv7NlsyswTGY3ySL8nLtjjLm4qOFCmlC5Bnkno&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4-uk":{"_id":"694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4","seriesID":"69415578d405d15a9557febf","slug":"il-divo-2007-1-1","name":"Il Divo","summary":"The story of Italian politician Giulio Andreotti, who has served as Prime Minister of Italy seven times since the restoration of democracy in 1946.","description":"In Rome, at dawn, when everyone is sleeping, one man is awake. That man is Giulio Andreotti. He's awake because he has to work, write books, move in fashionable circles and, last but not least, pray. Calm, crafty and inscrutable, Andreotti is a synonym of power in Italy for over four decades. At the beginning of the Nineties, this impassive yet insinuating, ambiguous yet reassuring figure appears set to assume his seventh mandate as Prime Minister without arrogance and without humility. Approaching seventy, Andreotti is a gerontocrat who, with all the attributes of God, is afraid of no one and does not know the meaning of awe, since he is accustomed to seeing it stamped on the faces of all his interlocutors. His satisfaction is muted, impalpable. For him, satisfaction is power, with which he has a symbiotic relationship. Power the way he likes it. Unwavering and immutable, from the outset. He emerges unscathed from everything: electoral battles, terrorist massacres, slanderous accusations. He is untouched by it all, unchanging. Until the strongest counter power in Italy, the Mafia, declares war on him. Then things change. Perhaps even for the enigmatic, immortal Andreotti. But the question is: do they really change or only appear to? We can be sure of one thing: it is difficult to tarnish Andreotti, the man who knows the ways of the world better than any of us.","duration":7865000,"originalContentDuration":6785000,"allotment":7865,"rating":"15+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/screenshot16_9_1765890081142.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Drama","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/poster_1765890081142.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/screenshot4_3_1765890081142.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/screenshot16_9_1765890081142.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"690cc49de1ac90de1202d714"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/poster16_9_1765890081142.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"originalReleaseDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/694157621a8e9be91bcbc3a4/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=GB&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=51.5100&deviceLon=-0.0800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&de