ada53737e6","seriesID":"6964bdb3ee4744ada53737c7","slug":"where-the-devil-hides-2014-1-1","name":"Where the Devil Hides","summary":"Terror overtakes a small village when six girls born on the same day mysteriously disappear on their 18th birthday.","description":"Something very strange happened in the small village of New Bethlehem, a devout community kept under the tight reins of the town's vigilant Elders. Six girls born on the same day to different mothers. Perhaps a coincidence or as most believe a chilling omen of something yet to come. Now, on the eve of their 18th birthday, the young women are mysteriously disappearing one by one and feared dead. Terror has overtaken this quiet community. Could this be the work of a serial killer, one of the village elders or a horrific prophecy come true, born of the supernatural, The Occult?","duration":5852000,"originalContentDuration":5132000,"allotment":5852,"rating":"15+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964bdb4ee4744ada53737e6/screenshot16_9_1787856127266.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Horror","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6964bdb4ee4744ada53737e6/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964bdb4ee4744ada53737e6/poster_1787856127266.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964bdb4ee4744ada53737e6/screenshot4_3_1787856127266.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964bdb4ee4744ada53737e6/screenshot16_9_1787856127266.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"6137524c6290550007e2607d"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964bdb4ee4744ada53737e6/poster16_9_1787856127266.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Alycia Debnam-Carey","Rufus Sewell","Thomas McDonell",