swTGY3ySL8nLtjjLm4qOFCmlC5Bnkno&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"6964c1e9a7396485f837f15f-uk":{"_id":"6964c1e9a7396485f837f15f","seriesID":"6964c1e8a7396485f837f140","slug":"nails-2017-1-1","name":"Nails","summary":"Recovering after a terrible accident, Dana is exposed to a dark and malevolent spirit who is intent on her destruction. After surviving a near-fatal accident, track coach and mother Dana awakens in hospital, paralysed and imprisoned in her own body.","description":"Recovering after a terrible accident, Dana is exposed to a dark and malevolent spirit who is intent on her destruction. After surviving a near-fatal accident, track coach and mother Dana awakens in hospital, paralysed and imprisoned in her own body. Whilst struggling to regain control of her life, Dana is confronted with a vindictive spirit; a terrifying presence called Nails, whom she is convinced exists inside her hospital room. Faced with skepticism from her husband, doctors and the staff, and believed to be suffering from a mental breakdown, Dana is left struggling to keep her grip on reality as the targeted attacks grow increasingly violent. To save her marriage and her life, Dana must find a way to convince her family that Nails is real before he succeeds in destroying her and everyone who stands in his way. From award winning film production company Fantastic Films (The Hallow and Let Us Prey) and the executive producer of Assault on Precinct 13.","duration":5813000,"originalContentDuration":5093000,"allotment":5813,"rating":"15+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1e9a7396485f837f15f/screenshot16_9_1768210925916.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Horror","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6964c1e9a7396485f837f15f/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1e9a7396485f837f15f/poster_1768210925916.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"asp