 Evans) is an unemployed dreamer. He spends his life hoping to win competitions in order to give his wife and children all the things they deserve. Angie (Kathy Burke), Robert's adoring and long-suffering wife, just wants Robert to face reality. She doesn't want them to be the family people cross the street to avoid. And his mother-in-law (Linda Bassett) just wants him to sorts his life out. One day, when Robert discovers that he has not won yet another dream family holiday of a lifetime, he decides to take matters into his own hands and steal one!","duration":5710000,"originalContentDuration":4990000,"allotment":5710,"rating":"15+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/screenshot16_9_1768210931817.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Comedy","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/poster_1768210931817.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/screenshot4_3_1768210931817.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/screenshot16_9_1768210931817.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"5ef87fe29af6550007434708"},{"id":"66867630564aaa00087c71a3"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/poster16_9_1768210931817.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Lee Evans","Kathy Burke","Linda Bassett","Eric Byrne","Terri Dumont"],"directors":["Tony Grounds"],"producers":["Greg Brenman"],"originalReleaseDate":"2001-09-14T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/6964c1f3a7396485f83950c5/maste