lai Lama: Enlightened","summary":"An inspiration to many and a messenger of peace, Dalai Lama is the man who has dedicated his entire life towards preserving the rich Tibetan culture.","description":"An inspiration to many and a messenger of peace, Dalai Lama is the man who has dedicated his entire life towards preserving the rich Tibetan culture.","duration":3300000,"originalContentDuration":2970000,"allotment":3300,"rating":"9+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/screenshot16_9.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Documentary","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/poster.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/screenshot4_3.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/screenshot16_9.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"5c5bf751f21b553c1f673ad6"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/poster16_9.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Dalai Lama","Abbe Holmes"],"directors":["Marilyn Higgins"],"originalReleaseDate":"2015-03-17T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/5e1589e625ce304162536f37/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=GB&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=51.5100&deviceLon=-0.0800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=GB&serverSideAds=true&sessionID=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&sid=04ec44b2-d506-11f1-9e7f-2af1ca94ebdb&userId=&jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjU3MGE4NTE5LTNhNzEtNGQ1Ni1iMTAyLTIwN2Q4MjI4MTZkYiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..12EU-uv7NlsyswTGY3ySL8nLtjjLm4qOFCmlC5Bnkno&masterJWTPassthrough=true"},"626f85d973a0a10014509d2f-uk":{"_id":"626f85d973a0a10014509d2f","seriesID":"626f85d773a0a10014509d28","slug":"gold-for-kim-a-life-for-north-koreas-leader-2018-1-1","name":"Gold for Kim - A Life for North Korea's Leader","summary":"A visit to one of the most isolated countries in the world.","description":"North Korea is a country of stark contrasts. On the one hand, it presents real socialist stereotypes like cryptic messages from a frozen time loop, combined with shocking reports on shortages. On the other hand, polished Pyongyang lures with a futuristic skyline, flashy amusement parks and department stores with a range of goods equal to those in western consumer meccas. Focusing on sports, we try to get into conversation with athletes and amateurs to get a new perspective on this isolated country. Months of planning are tested by unexpected challenges. An interesting tour de force through gyms, riding clubs, water parks, and factories starts, including visits to a kindergarten and a soccer academy. With contradictory experiences and non-staged scenes of everyday life, we paint a picture of North Korea beyond common clichés.","duration":3660000,"originalContentDuration":3135000,"allotment":3660,"rating":"9+","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/626f85d973a0a10014509d2f/screenshot16_9_1766444041201.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Documentary","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/626f85d973a0a10014509d2f/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/626f85d973a0a10014509d2f/poster_1766444041201.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=69